From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OAN Messaging <messaging@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:32:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(visits): farmer SMS for planned and rescheduled visits
 through the OAN Messaging Service

When the Development Agent ticks notify_farmer_sms, plan_visit and reschedule_visit
queue one SMS to the farmer (phone from DA Farmer Reference) with
oan_messaging_connector.queue_sms: purpose transactional, expiring when the visit starts
(capped inside the 7-day horizon), source_reference da:visit:<visit>:<event>. A past or
closed visit, a visit without a farmer phone, or an idempotent replan sends nothing.
Development Agents are not sent SMS.

Adds oan_messaging_connector to required_apps, fetches it in CI (repository variable\nOAN_MESSAGING_CONNECTOR_REPO), and eight tests.
